	(text "INTERCONNECT J30 - 26-way IDC ribbon to POWER BOARD J30 (pin 1 to pin 1)\n5V comes from the power board; 3.3V is made HERE (U11) so this board also runs from USB alone.\nBench testing on USB: UNPLUG the ribbon so USB doesn't try to feed the power board.\n+12V (18): 12V rail monitor + 12V pressure sensors.  SAFE_EN (12) out, ESTOP_OK/HP_OK (19/20) in.\nRLY11/RLY12 (21/22) = valves 9/10 from MCP23017 #2.  GND: 3, 4, 11, 23, 24.  25/26 spare."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 25.40 132.08 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "43de490a-f29e-4e2c-bd14-f9c19f6bc725"))
